Description: Offline Pokémon IV calculator for the whole National Pokédex
 Pick a Pokémon, enter its level and stats, and iv31 works out its IVs,
 the natures that suit it, and which stats matter most. Includes EV and
 Hidden Power calculators, EV yields with wild locations, a type chart,
 a Secret Power and Nature Power guide, and favorites. Covers Gen I to IX.
